<title>SINGAPORE: TENNIS-SINGAPORE OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SINGAPORE OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the men's Singapore Open on Monday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round:</p>
<p>Thomas Johansson (Sweden) beat Scott Draper (Australia) 6-4 3-6 6-3</p>
<p>Jonathan Stark (U.S.) beat Jean-Philippe Fleurian (France) 5-7 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Andrei Olhovskiy (Russia) beat Thanakorn Srichaphan (Thailand) 6-2 6-0</p>
<p>Grant Stafford (South Africa) beat Martin Damm (Czech Republic) 7-6 (8-6) 6-0</p>
<p>Guillaume Roaux (France) beat Neville Godwin (South Africa) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Patrick Rafter (Australia) beat Shuzo Matsuoka (Japan) 6-4 6-2  </p>
<p>Sjeng Schalken (Netherlands) beat Mats Wilander (Sweden) 6-2 6-2</p>
</text>
